</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8357 -&nbsp;32812 - 8261 - 623</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8357 - (32812 +&nbsp;8261 +&nbsp;623)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8357 - (32812 +&nbsp;8261 +&nbsp;623)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8357 - 41696</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= -33339</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(100000 - 1) - (32000 + 312) - ( 48000 + 219) - (11000 + 111) - 4169</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 9000 - 4812</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 4188</p>\r\n", "solution_hi": "<!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">-->\r\n<p>सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 4</strong> अर्थात <strong>-33339&nbsp;</strong>है।&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>99999 - 32312 - 48219 - 11111 - 32812 - 8261 - 623</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 67687 -&nbsp;48219 - 11111 - 32812 - 8261 - 623</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 19468 -&nbsp;11111 - 32812 - 8261 - 623</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8357 -&nbsp;32812 - 8261 - 623</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8357 - (32812 +&nbsp;8261 +&nbsp;623)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8357 - (32812 +&nbsp;8261 +&nbsp;623)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8357 - 41696</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= -33339</p>\r\n\r\n<p><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--></p>\r\n", "marks": 2, "neg": 0.6666666666666666, "chap": "Calculation"}, {"q_en": "<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{38}\\)</span>&nbsp;= ?</p>\r\n", "q_hi": "<p>&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{38}\\)</span>&nbsp;= ?</p>\r\n", "options_en": ["<p>6.17</p>\r\n", "<p>6.89</p>\r\n", "<p>5.88</p>\r\n", "<p>5.27</p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p>6.17</p>\r\n", "<p>6.89</p>\r\n", "<p>5.88</p>\r\n", "<p>5.27</p>\r\n"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>The correct answer is <strong>option 1</strong> i.e. <strong>6.17</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{36+2}\\)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>a = 36, b = 2</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Square root =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt a + \\frac{b}{2\\sqrt a}\\)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt {36} + \\frac{2}{2\\sqrt {36}}\\)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 6 + 1/6</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 6.17</p>\r\n", "solution_hi": "<!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">-->\r\n<p>सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 1</strong> अर्थात् <strong>6.17&nbsp;</strong>है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{36+2}\\)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>a = 36, b = 2</p>\r\n\r\n<p>वर्गमूल =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt a + \\frac{b}{2\\sqrt a}\\)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt {36} + \\frac{2}{2\\sqrt {36}}\\)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 6 + 1/6</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 6.17</p>\r\n\r\n<p><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--></p>\r\n", "marks": 2, "neg": 0.6666666666666666, "chap": "Calculation"}, {"q_en": "<p>74&nbsp;&times; 11</p>\r\n", "q_hi": "<p>74&nbsp;&times; 11</p>\r\n", "options_en": ["<p>924</p>\r\n", "<p>824</p>\r\n", "<p>714</p>\r\n", "<p>814</p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p>924</p>\r\n", "<p>824</p>\r\n", "<p>714</p>\r\n", "<p>814</p>\r\n"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>The correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>option 4&nbsp;</strong>i.e.&nbsp;<strong>814</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>74&nbsp;&times; 11</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want to multiply a number by 11, you can use this trick.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let a number ab is multiplied&nbsp;by 11. Then the answer will be:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unit Digit: b</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tens Digit: a + b</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hundreds&nbsp;Digit: a</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unit Digit: 4</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tens Digit: 7&nbsp;+ 4 = 11 = 1 (1 carry forward)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hundreds&nbsp;Digit: 7 + 1 (carried forward) = 8</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Final Answer: 814</p>\r\n", "solution_hi": "<p>सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 4</strong> यानी <strong>814</strong> है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>74 &times; 11</p>\r\n\r\n<p>यदि आप किसी संख्या को 11 से गुणा करना चाहते हैं, तो आप इस ट्रिक का उपयोग कर सकते हैं।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>मान लीजिए कि किसी संख्या ab को 11 से गुणा किया जाता है। तो उत्तर होगा:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>इकाई अंक: b</p>\r\n\r\n<p>दहाई अंक: a + b</p>\r\n\r\n<p>सैकड़ा अंक: a</p>\r\n\r\n<p>तो,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>इकाई अंक: 4</p>\r\n\r\n<p>दहाई अंक: 7 + 4 = 11 = 1 (1 आगे बढ़ाएँ)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>सैकड़ा अंक: 7 + 1 (आगे बढ़ा हुआ) = 8</p>\r\n\r\n<p>अंतिम उत्तर: 814</p>\r\n", "marks": 2, "neg": 0.6666666666666666, "chap": "Calculation"}, {"q_en": "<p>115&nbsp;&times; 114</p>\r\n", "q_hi": "<p>115&nbsp;&times; 114</p>\r\n", "options_en": ["<p>12110</p>\r\n", "<p>13220</p>\r\n", "<p>13110</p>\r\n", "<p>13120</p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p>12110</p>\r\n", "<p>13220</p>\r\n", "<p>13110</p>\r\n", "<p>13120</p>\r\n"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>The correct answer is <strong>option 3</strong> i.e. <strong>13110</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hranker.com/admin/assets/uploads/ckeditor/262025_06_20_12_39_05.png\" style=\"height:85px; width:300px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "solution_hi": "<!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">-->\r\n<p>सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 3</strong> अर्थात् <strong>13110&nbsp;</strong>है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hranker.com/admin/assets/uploads/ckeditor/262025_06_20_12_39_05.png\" style=\"height:85px; width:300px\" /></p>\r\n", "marks": 2, "neg": 0.6666666666666666, "chap": "Calculation"}, {"q_en": "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">7632 + 3251+ 8723 + 6993+ 7089=? </span></span></p>\r\n", "q_hi": "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">7632 + 3251+ 8723 + 6993+ 7089=? </span></span></p>\r\n", "options_en": ["<p><span><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">33788</span></span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">32688</span></span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">33678</span></span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">33688</span></span></span></p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p><span><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">33788</span></span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span